    "description": "Suruga Bank Ltd. provides various banking and financial products and services to individuals and corporate customers in Japan. The company offers deposit products, such as time, non-interest bearing, savings, foreign currency, and other deposits, as well as current and general accounts; property, card, housing, second house, startup, and business up term loans, as well as loans by purpose; credit and debit cards; overdrafts; and other financing products. It also provides investment trust, public bond, pension contribution, insurance, inheritance/trust, lottery, foreign currency, pay-easy, web direct, safe deposit box, external linkage, remittance service, fund management, e-combination, payment, nursing care/medical care/dispensing compensation receivable factoring, mortgage, and internet and telephone banking services. In addition, the company offers money lending, guarantee, printing, leasing, and agency services, as well as advisory and consulting services. Suruga Bank Ltd. company was incorporated in 1895 and is headquartered in Numazu, Japan."
